    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（刺剑），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这件武器看上去很普通，但其中蕴藏着的强大幻术可以让使用者巧妙地迷惑对手。你使用这件魔法武器进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+2加值。你持握这把剑期间，获得以下增益： </p><p><em><strong>愚者佯攻Fool’s Feint。</strong></em>以一个附赠动作，你可以选择一个距离你5尺以内的生物作为你的目标发动佯攻。直到你的下一个回合开始为止，你对目标的攻击检定具有优势。此附赠动作一经使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p><em><strong>转向Misdirect。</strong></em>当距你60尺内的一个生物以你为目标进行一次攻击检定时，你可以用一个反应迫使该生物进行一次[[/save ability=int dc=15]]豁免。若其豁免失败，则此次攻击会改为以攻击者触及内的你选择的另一个生物为目标。此反应一经使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p>This weapon appears ordinary, but it bears strong illusion magic that allows its wielder to skillfully deceive opponents.</p><p>You have a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. While wielding it, you also gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fool's Feint\"><span class=\"bold\">Fool's Feint.</span> As a bonus action, you can feint, choosing a creature within 5 feet of you as your target. Until the start of your next turn, you have advantage on attack rolls against the target. Once this bonus action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Misdirect\"><span class=\"bold\">Misdirect.</span> When a creature within 60 feet of you targets you with an attack roll, you can use your reaction to require that creature to make a [[/save ability=int dc=15]] saving throw. On a failed save, the attack instead targets another creature of your choice that is within the attacker's reach. Once this reaction has been used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
